          [ Frontend ]
        HTML / CSS / JS
                    |
                    | HTTP POST /refactor
                    | { "code": "..." }
                    v
          [ FastAPI Backend ]
                    |
                    | API Request
                    v
             [ NVIDIA NIM ]
                    |
                    | Nemotron Model
                    v
             [ AI Analysis ]
                    |
